OL,3,GNEWSAMan loses legal case against US
OL,4,Aextradition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Nottinghamshire entrepreneur accused
OL,7,Fof serious crimes in the United States
OL,8,Fhas lost a legal battle against
OL,9,Fextradition.
OL,11,FSukhi Ghuman, 48, of Syerston Hall near
OL,12,FNewark, has strongly denied defrauding
OL,13,Fthe US healthcare system and smuggling
OL,14,Funlicensed drugs.
OL,16,FThe US authorities want to put Mr
OL,17,FGhuman and his ex-wife Kiranjit on
OL,18,Ftrial over charges relating to cancer
OL,19,Fclinics they bought in California and
OL,20,FArizona.
